abstract: >
  Reproducible integrated viewer combining longitudinal Democracy Index data
  for Peru, Latin America and the world (2020–2025) with three
  evidence-conditioned scenarios for Peru to 2030. Code is released under MIT;
  documentation and original narrative content use CC BY 4.0, while third-party
  inputs retain their original terms.
